  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at the Sahara home, Kayo calls her daughter Megumi out of the bath because dinner is on the table. What starts as a warm mealtime moment quickly turns strict again when Kayo inspects Megumi's hands. Listen to the gentle-sounding motherly commands in Japanese.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "恵美さん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "早く上がりなさい。ごはんできてますから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "今、出ます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "どうかしら？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "とってもおいしそう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "ほんと？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "うれしいわ。どうぞ召し上がってちょうだい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "いただきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "その前に、もう一度手を洗ってきなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "お風呂に入りましたけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "手が汚れてるでしょ？もう一度洗ってきなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even inside her own house, Kayo speaks with refined, controlling poise, while Megumi answers politely. Let's look closer at their exchange.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "早く上がりなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come out of the bath soon.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "ごはんできてますから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Dinner is ready.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "今、出ます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am coming out now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "どうかしら？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you think?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "とってもおいしそう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It looks so delicious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "どうぞ召し上がってちょうだい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please go ahead and eat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "いただきます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for this meal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "その前に、もう一度手を洗ってきなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before that, go wash your hands one more time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "megumi",
      "t": "お風呂に入りましたけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I just took a bath, though.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kayo",
      "t": "手が汚れてるでしょ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your hands are dirty, right?'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
