    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Table phrases like \"oishisou\" and \"itadakimasu\" come up at almost every Japanese meal, and \"mou ichido\" is the cleanest way to ask for something one more time. See you next time.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
